  "general": {
    "description": "A towed brush chipper. Hitch it to a truck (trailer_standard, as UNU's hitch bumpers and CSM's work trucks offer), pull the lever on the engine housing to start it, and drop logs, brush and leaves on the feed table: they come out as Mulch in the hopper. Click the hopper to open it. It takes anything dropped behind it, so stop it when you are done.",
